sequenceDiagram
    participant OS as Android (Zygote)
    participant App as Application
    participant Act as First Activity (SplashScreen)
    participant BG as Background (Ch 3)

    OS->>App: fork process -> Application.onCreate (AOT-compiled via baseline profile, Ch 92)
    App->>App: CRITICAL init only - crash handler (Ch 83), DI essentials (Ch 46)
    App->>BG: defer/parallel - analytics, image (Ch 59), flags (Ch 40) off-main (Ch 3)
    App->>Act: launch first Activity - SplashScreen themed window (no extra activity)
    Act->>Act: setContent - render SKELETON (Ch 93) - NO main-thread I/O
    Act-->>OS: FIRST FRAME drawn = TTID (fast)
    Act->>BG: load home data off-main (Ch 3/5) - lazy repo built on first use (Ch 46)
    BG-->>Act: data ready
    Act->>Act: reportFullyDrawn() = TTFD (Ch 45)
